                <LessonTakeaways>
                        <LessonTakeaway>The .NET CLI follows the pattern: <code>dotnet [command] [arguments] [options]</code></LessonTakeaway>
                        <LessonTakeaway>Use <code>dotnet new</code> to create projects from templates.</LessonTakeaway>
                        <LessonTakeaway>Use <code>dotnet watch run</code> for hot reload during development.</LessonTakeaway>
                        <LessonTakeaway>Use <code>dotnet publish</code> with appropriate options for deployment.</LessonTakeaway>
